"NSMicrophoneUsageDescription" = "BE Mastery uses the microphone so you can record your spoken English for pronunciation feedback, send short voice turns to a practice partner, and talk in a live practice call. Lesson recordings stay on your device; a voice turn you choose to send, and the audio used for scoring, are sent over an encrypted connection to our servers.";
"NSSpeechRecognitionUsageDescription" = "BE Mastery uses speech recognition to turn your spoken English into text, so it can check your pronunciation and show which words came through clearly. Recognition is handled by iOS; the app receives only the text.";
"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "BE Mastery uses the camera only for the optional Posture Coach in the Shadowing Studio. Frames are analysed on your phone in real time; no image or video is stored or sent anywhere.";
